  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Visions of the Void overwhelm a creature within range, which makes a Wisdom saving throw. On a failure, it takes 2d10 Psychic damage and has the &amp;Reference[frightened apply=false]{Frightened} condition for 1 minute; while Frightened, it also has the &amp;Reference[stunned apply=false]{Stunned} condition until the end of your next turn. At the end of each of its turns, the target repeats the save, ending the effect on itself on a success. On a successful initial save, it takes half as much damage only.</p><p><strong>Using a Higher-Level Spell Slot.</strong> The damage increases by 1d10 for each spell slot level above 4.</p>",
      "chat": ""
    },
